WEBVTT

00:19:57.966 --> 00:20:02.109
is that China, and actually, most of Asia,

00:20:02.133 --> 00:20:05.729
haven't been founded on believing

00:20:05.753 --> 00:20:10.458
that there are individual,
inalienable rights

00:20:10.482 --> 00:20:12.323
that trump everything.

00:20:12.925 --> 00:20:17.084
The belief is more "We want
the society to be great,

00:20:17.108 --> 00:20:19.020
the country to be great,

00:20:19.044 --> 00:20:21.234
and our village to be great.

00:20:21.258 --> 00:20:24.370
Each of us is just part of the whole.

00:20:24.394 --> 00:20:28.076
And it is worth it
to make the whole better

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:32.656
and each person's individual rights
are not unimportant,